model {
  extend basalt.clientConnection {
    metadata {
      constraint "The local gateway limits simultaneous connection starts, not active model or tool streams. Up to 1,024 authenticated starts wait in arrival order for at most thirty seconds before dispatch; overflow refuses with retryable unavailability. HTTP response headers, WebSocket upgrades and refused handshakes release start capacity on both direct and native tunnel transports. Cancellation removes queued work; connection controls and shutdown still stop every queued and active operation. A failure before dispatch remains retryable without replaying an uncertain model request. Deployment instance count and provider account capacity remain independent."
    }
  }
}
